{% comment %}
夹注 jiazhu：论断横排在左（宋体 400、head 档，宽 9 字），右边一条竖向发丝线后是一栏夹注式的支撑段落（body，两端对齐，ink-2），出处压在夹注栏底（caption ink-3）。像正文旁的小字双行夹注，主次靠字号和墨色拉开。
朱色：论断前一枚朱色实心圈点（● 的写法，CSS 画），全页唯一的朱。入场：论断从左滑入，夹注洇出。
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  :scope {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--ds-space-7) var(--ds-space-8);
    background: var(--ds-color-paper);
    color: var(--ds-color-ink);
    font-family: var(--ds-font-body);
    text-spacing-trim: trim-both;
  }
  :scope::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    opacity: .45;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='240' height='240'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='.85' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 .30 0 0 0 0 .24 0 0 0 0 .17 0 0 0 .16 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
  }
  p, h1, h2, ol, ul, li, figure, figcaption, blockquote { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  p, li, blockquote { text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2 { text-wrap: balance; }

  .page {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 640px;
    column-gap: var(--ds-space-9);
    align-items: center;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .claim {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 9.2em;
    font-family: var(--ds-font-cjk);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-head);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .claim::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: -.7em;
    top: .62em;
    width: .26em;
    height: .26em;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ds-color-zhu);
  }
  .note {
    padding-left: var(--ds-space-5);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--ds-color-rule);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-body);
  }
  .support {
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-2);
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .source {
    margin-top: var(--ds-space-5);
    font-size: var(--ds-type-caption);
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ds-color-ink-3);
  }
  .support:has(> :empty), .source:has(> :empty) { display: none; }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <h1 class="claim" data-ds-enter="left" data-ds-step="glide" data-ds-ease="paper" data-ds-distance="3" data-ds-order="1">{{ slots.claim }}</h1>
  <div class="note" data-ds-enter="fade" data-ds-step="ink" data-ds-ease="ink" data-ds-order="2">
    <p class="support">{{ slots.support }}</p>
    <p class="source">{{ slots.source }}</p>
  </div>
</div>
